* <Natural Source Header
* RDEFAR - Modify/Display Active Report attributes
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* mrs 93-06-26 s(999999) created
* mrs 93-10-15 s(999999) NAF Interface implemented
