* mrs 95-11-28 s(999999) extended spool attributes
* mrs 97-05-27 p(162705) recompiled (changes in rdefary& and eomarm-p)
* mrs 97-05-27 p(162737) recompiled (changes in rdefary& and eomarm-p)
* jwo 97-06-04 p(162705) new map rdefarz& fro bs2000 ext. attr. added
* jvd 98-10-08 s(999999) Spool Attributes
